        <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.9rem;">
          Discover interest club activities, join coding hackathons, fests, workshops, and RSVP easily with your student profile.
        </p>
        <a href="/events" class="text-primary font-weight-600 mt-auto pt-3" style="font-size: 0.85rem;">View Calendar &rarr;</a>
