        <h4 class="mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-primary mr-2" style="margin-right: 0.5rem;"></i>100% Confession Safety</h4>
        <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.6;">
          Your confession credentials are never tied to your public profile. Interact, express, and read campus thoughts without hesitation.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card" style="border-left-color: var(--secondary-color);">
        <h4 class="mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-location-crosshairs text-secondary mr-2" style="margin-right: 0.5rem;"></i>Precise Retrievals</h4>
        <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.6;">
          Searchable locations, category tags, and clean photo cards help you recover keys, ID cards, and books within hours.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card" style="border-left-color: var(--accent-color);">
        <h4 class="mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt text-accent mr-2" style="margin-right: 0.5rem;"></i>Zero Load Lag</h4>
        <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.6;">
          Highly optimized, clean HTML5/CSS3 components ensure quick, lightweight responsive operations on slow campus Wi-Fi networks.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
